.TH "nvme_init_manage_export_port" 9 "nvme_init_manage_export_port" "October 2026" "libnvme API manual" LINUX
.SH NAME
nvme_init_manage_export_port \- Initialize passthru command for Manage Exported Port
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B "void" nvme_init_manage_export_port
.BI "(struct libnvme_passthru_cmd *cmd "  ","
.BI "__u8 sel "  ","
.BI "__u8 mos "  ","
.BI "void *data "  ","
.BI "__u32 len "  ");"
.SH ARGUMENTS
.IP "cmd" 12
Passthru command to use
.IP "sel" 12
Select (SEL): management operation to perform, see \fIenum
nvme_manage_export_port_sel\fP
.IP "mos" 12
Management Operation Specific (MOS): specific to \fIsel\fP
.IP "data" 12
Pointer to data buffer
.IP "len" 12
Length of \fIdata\fP
.SH "DESCRIPTION"
Initializes the passthru command buffer for the Manage Exported Port
command.
